          {
            "title": "Links",
            "id": 70811,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Metni bir web sayfasına bağlamak için bir Tekdüzen Kaynak Konumu (<strong>URL</strong>) ile birlikte <code>href=\"\"</code> ekleriz. <code>href</code>, \"hypertext reference\" ifadesinin kısaltmasıdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>href</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Metni bir web sayfasına bağlamak için URL ile <code>href=\"\"</code> ekle. <code>https://mimo.org</code> adresine giden açılış etiketini tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"src\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;href&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>a</code>, ardından <code>href</code>, <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Attributes",
            "id": 70809,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>href</code> bir <strong>özniteliktir</strong>. Tüm özniteliklerin ortak iki özelliği vardır: ek bilgiler sağlarlar ve açılış etiketinin içinde yer alırlar.</p><p>Öznitelikler, etiketin adından sonra ve <code>&gt;</code> kapanış işaretinden önce eklenir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>href</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Öznitelikler ek bilgi sağlar ve açılış etiketinin içinde yer alır.</p><p><code>href</code> özniteliği, bağlantının hedef URL'sini yani web adresini ayarlar.</p><p><code>href</code> özniteliğini etiket adından sonra yerleştir, ardından açılış etiketini <code>&gt;</code> ile tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"a\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;href&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/a&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>href</code>, ardından <code>&gt;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Equal sign",
            "id": 70810,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir web sayfasına, özniteliğin ardından <code>=</code> ekleyip tırnak işaretleri arasına değer olarak bir URL yazarak bağlantı veririz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>\"</code> ve sonra <code>https://mimo.org</code>, <code>\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir web sayfasına, özniteliğin ardından <code>=</code> ekleyip tırnak işaretleri arasına değer olarak bir URL yazarak bağlantı veririz.</p><p>Bağlantıyı, <code>href</code> değeri tam olarak <code>https://mimo.org</code> olacak şekilde tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;\" class=\"meta\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"body\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"html\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"a\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/a&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>href</code>, ardından <code>=</code>, <code>\"</code>, <code>https://mimo.org</code> ve son olarak <code>\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
