            "title": "Create a link",
            "id": 117993,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>href</code> niteliği <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code> olarak ayarlanmış bir açılış <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> etiketi oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>href</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>https://mimo.org</code> adresine bağlantı veren açılış anchor etiketini oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"1\" /><option startIndex=\"1\" endIndex=\"2\" /><option startIndex=\"3\" endIndex=\"7\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"src\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Learn to Code\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>&lt;</code>, ardından <code>a</code>, <code>href</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>\"https://mimo.org\"</code> ve son olarak <code>&gt;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
